You're #C000246204in the Far Side of the Moon#CDEF,
where #C236196003BB#CDEF was born;
where the #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF were born―――

#C000246204Command Seals#CDEF hold absolute directive authority over Servants;
it's a special command that invokes all kinds of
coercive power upon a Servant in return for expending one.

Regardless of whether you have a past or not,
your abilities are hardwired;
the performance you exhibit is hardwired.

If the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF discovers this,
forget about her experience;
her entire framework will get deleted.
